      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "dDest",
      "originalText": "Unsubscribe! Clear timers! Prevent memory leaks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "if5bHg6ipH31PFuzLgm2Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38.046478271484375,
      "y": 930.625,
      "width": 283.90704345703125,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 71099875,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 477017699,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771964926088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: constructor vs ngOnInit?\nngOnInit: @Input() ready, Angular fully\ninit.\nconstructor: only DI -- @Input() NOT\nset yet.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q1",
      "originalText": "Q: constructor vs ngOnInit?\nngOnInit: @Input() ready, Angular fully init.\nconstructor: only DI -- @Input() NOT set yet.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HAzjohQmzAHkeGletVPnd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 379.9090270996094,
      "y": 930.625,
      "width": 276.18194580078125,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1007432067,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 801674573,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771964926088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: When does ngOnChanges NOT fire?\nIf the component has NO @Input()\nprops,\nngOnChanges NEVER fires. Not even\nonce.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q2",
      "originalText": "Q: When does ngOnChanges NOT fire?\nIf the component has NO @Input() props,\nngOnChanges NEVER fires. Not even once.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YMNdzKaxQApGCzHvJBcQG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 719.5890502929688,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 272.8218994140625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1060178211,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2125459971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771964926088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Why avoid logic in ngDoCheck?\nRuns on EVERY CD cycle (100s per\nsec).\nHeavy logic = serious performance kill.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q3",
      "originalText": "Q: Why avoid logic in ngDoCheck?\nRuns on EVERY CD cycle (100s per sec).\nHeavy logic = serious performance kill.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F6bfhxeO0umLBOoqPGItI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.55902099609375,
      "y": 1068.625,
      "width": 278.8819580078125,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c026d3",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 588901571,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2046976941,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771964926088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: ContentInit vs ViewInit?\nContent = ng-content projected (fires\nfirst).\nView = own template rendered (fires\nafter).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q4",
      "originalText": "Q: ContentInit vs ViewInit?\nContent = ng-content projected (fires first).\nView = own template rendered (fires after).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-OHE5cyRmIz4_L1flVLz8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380.83154296875,
      "y": 1063.25,
      "width": 274.3369140625,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1264933987,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1753790883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771964926088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Can ngOnChanges fire before\nngOnInit?\nYES! ngOnChanges fires FIRST every\ntime\nan @Input() changes, then ngOnInit\nonce.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q5",
      "originalText": "Q: Can ngOnChanges fire before ngOnInit?\nYES! ngOnChanges fires FIRST every time\nan @Input() changes, then ngOnInit once.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SgfxaoAXF8_C93E-_dXDz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 715.4714965820312,
      "y": 1087.375,
      "width": 281.0570068359375,
      "height": 56.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1707728301,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1286825485,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771964926088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: How to prevent memory leaks?\nIn ngOnDestroy: call unsubscribe(),\nclearInterval(), removeEventListener().",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "q6",
      "originalText": "Q: How to prevent memory leaks?\nIn ngOnDestroy: call unsubscribe(),\nclearInterval(), removeEventListener().",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
